14099614edd4\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 1$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 1$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\cos{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\" :question/answer-fields \"b70a9d3f-b58a-5a97-850d-a37b2d822b32\"] [:db/ensure \"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions \"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\"] [:db/add \"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\"] [:db/add \"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\" :answer/id #uuid \"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\"] [:db/add \"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\" :a