,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"cfc0bcd5-2490-5028-8991-b48ed70c3add\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"cfc0bcd5-2490-5028-8991-b48ed70c3add\" :question/answer-fields \"7d16b70a-bf8f-53d5-96b3-61367669c8c3\"] [:db/ensure \"cfc0bcd5-2490-5028-8991-b48ed70c3add\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions \"cfc0bcd5-2490-5028-8991-b48ed70c3add\"] [:db/add \"c92a62ca-1d41-59c6-9cdb-668e1fdc0183\" :answer/id #uuid \"c92a62ca-1d41-59c6-9cdb-668e1fdc0183\"] [:db/add \"c92a62ca-1d41-59c6-9cdb-668e1fdc0183\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c92a62ca-1d41-59c6-9cdb-668e1fdc0183\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"c92a62ca-1d41-59c6-9cdb-668e1fdc0183\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a28e74c4-1971-54b9-85c5-d8a29b05c8de\" :answer/id #uuid \"a28e74c4-1971-54b9-85c5-d8a29b05c8de\"] [:db/add \"a28e74c4-1971-54b9-85c5-d8a29b05c8de\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a28e74c4-1971-54b9-85c5-d8a29b05c8de\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"a28e74c4-1971-54b9-85c5-d8a29b05c8de\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"eea5415f-a246-51f2-97e5-c0b17bbec35e\" :answer/id #uuid \"eea5415f-a246-51f2-97e5-c0b17bbec35e\"] [:db/add \"eea5415f-a246-51f2-97e5-c0b17bbec35e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"eea5415f-a246-51f2-97e5-c0b17bbec35e\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"eea5415f-a246-51f2-97e5-c0b17bbec35e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"92ef672e-ee09-5a0b-a280-10e0626bce0a\" :answer/id #uuid \"92ef672e-ee09-5a0b-a280-10e0626bce0a\"] [:db/add \"92ef672e-ee09-5a0b-a280-10e0626bce0a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"92ef672e-ee09-5a0b-a280-10e0626bce0a\" :answer/value \"\\\\in