question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 2$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\cos{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{\\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"8a4f75e6-6f41-5255-bb9b-56a906f714e7\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"8a4f75e6-6f41-5255-bb9b-56a906f714e7\" :question/answer-fields \"bc04fd17-21a7-5780-bf51-df77d73d6c0a\"] [:db/ensure \"8a4f75e6-6f41-5255-bb9b-56a906f714e7\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions \"8a4f75e6-6f41-5255-bb9b-56a906f714e7\"] [:db/add \"8b0a7f1d-d739-598c-8722-9081804e023d\" :answer/id #uuid \"8b0a7f1d-d739-598c-8722-9081804e023d\"] [:db/add \"8b0a7f1d-d739-598c-8722-9081804e023d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8b0a7f1d-d739-598c-8722-9081804e023d\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"8b0a7f1d-d739-598c-8722-9081804e023d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ee1a5af2-9fcb-51bd-ad8a-d4f72263e8a5\" :answer/id #uuid \"ee1a5af2-9fcb-51bd-ad8a-d4f72263e8a5\"] [:db/add \"ee1a5af2-9fcb-51bd-ad8a-d4f72263e8a5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ee1a5af2-9fcb-51bd-ad8a-d4f72263e8a5\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ee1a5af2-9fcb-51bd-ad8a-d4f72263e8a5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b0cb935f-bf33-5863-b288-986fc938c011\" :answer/id #uuid \"b0cb935f-bf33-5863-b288-986fc938c011\"] [:db/add \"b0cb935f-bf33-5863-b288-986fc938c011\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b0cb935f-bf33-5863-b288-986fc938c011\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\math