c4\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{\\\\tan{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"f0a8c230-87a3-5723-b85f-4967952af1c4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 2$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{\\\\tan{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"f0a8c230-87a3-5723-b85f-4967952af1c4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"f0a8c230-87a3-5723-b85f-4967952af1c4\" :question/answer-fields \"2e369801-d8cb-518d-93ed-b1d974171264\"] [17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions \"f0a8c230-87a3-5723-b85f-4967952af1c4\"] [\"c0999e2d-64f9-52e7-9720-d0eb8206448f\" :answer/id #uuid \"c0999e2d-64f9-52e7-9720-d0eb8206448f\"] [\"c0999e2d-64f9-52e7-9720-d0eb8206448f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c0999e2d-64f9-52e7-9720-d0eb8206448f\" :answer/value \"-6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"35109246-3fdc-5042-882a-69fdbf9b0c1b\" :answer/id #uuid \"35109246-3fdc-5042-882a-69fdbf9b0c1b\"] [\"35109246-3fdc-5042-882a-69fdbf9b0c1b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"35109246-3fdc-5042-882a-69fdbf9b0c1b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"60bcbc44-64d6-51c5-93b2-347ba8258c29\" :answer/id #uuid \"60bcbc44-64d6-51c5-93b2-347ba8258c29\"] [\"60bcbc44-64d6-51c5-93b2-347ba8258c29\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"60bcbc44-64d6-51c5-93b2-347ba8258c29\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"26cfff16-a171-576a