\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{\\\\cos{\\\\left(x \\\\right)} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n-3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"27c56402-ae7c-5947-a07d-e1f38c987e3b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"27c56402-ae7c-5947-a07d-e1f38c987e3b\" :question/answer-fields \"9555fbde-5b1c-5fb7-94b3-3ab841f14476\"] [17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions \"27c56402-ae7c-5947-a07d-e1f38c987e3b\"] [\"daf5ef2e-b42b-5dd8-a83d-c80146b7bec1\" :answer/id #uuid \"daf5ef2e-b42b-5dd8-a83d-c80146b7bec1\"] [\"daf5ef2e-b42b-5dd8-a83d-c80146b7bec1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"daf5ef2e-b42b-5dd8-a83d-c80146b7bec1\" :answer/value \"-6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"0ed260cc-2090-58a2-8064-67d300676c23\" :answer/id #uuid \"0ed260cc-2090-58a2-8064-67d300676c23\"] [\"0ed260cc-2090-58a2-8064-67d300676c23\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0ed260cc-2090-58a2-8064-67d300676c23\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"a66f1552-412e-534b-86fa-98e0861b8127\" :answer/id #uuid \"a66f1552-412e-534b-86fa-98e0861b8127\"] [\"a66f1552-412e-534b-86fa-98e0861b8127\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a66f1552-412e-534b-86fa-98e0861b8127\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"1518591d-6658-521d-bad8-25d3cc4fd9b5\" :answer/id #uuid \"1518591d-6658-521d-bad8-25d3cc4fd9b5\"] [\"1518591d-6658-521d-bad8-25d3cc4fd9b5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1518591d-6658-521d-bad8-25d3cc4fd9b5\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"76cc3e1b-7e19-5011-9a99-8cc9381549de\" :