d{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\" :question/answer-fields \"b70a9d3f-b58a-5a97-850d-a37b2d822b32\"] [17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions \"bb58bcea-34e0-549b-b68b-14099614edd4\"] [\"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\"] [\"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c2883230-856d-5aec-acec-3b82a19068cf\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\" :answer/id #uuid \"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\"] [\"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6d89910a-3629-5057-9f97-6b32c32c4dde\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"dfa75273-3c54-53ef-9d4d-a98cbc3fa3b2\" :answer/id #uuid \"dfa75273-3c54-53ef-9d4d-a98cbc3fa3b2\"] [\"dfa75273-3c54-53ef-9d4d-a98cbc3fa3b2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"dfa75273-3c54-53ef-9d4d-a98cbc3fa3b2\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"039c89fb-4882-53a1-9118-588e80fb093b\" :answer/id #uuid \"039c89fb-4882-53a1-9118-588e80fb093b\"] [\"039c89fb-4882-53a1-9118-588e80fb093b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"039c89fb-4882-53a1-9118-588e80fb093b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"d43dc9ca-3e38-5211-8c39-c24399530a4c\" :answer/id #uuid \"d43dc9ca-3e38-5211-8c39-c24399530a4c\"] [\"d43dc9ca-3e38-5211-8c39-c24399530a4c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d43dc9ca-3e38-5211-8c39-c24399530a4c\" :answer/value \"-6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"63dcec39-549e-5039-9442-a0a995f59f47\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"63dcec39-549e-5